OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786816101
OL,3,CDevastated residents share their
OL,4,Cstories in aftermath of Midlands fires
OL,6,FResidents impacted by wildfires in the
OL,7,FWest Midlands have spoken of the
OL,8,Fdevastation and stress they have
OL,9,Fcaused, with many struggling to return
OL,10,Fto normal life.
OL,12,FFirefighters battled huge infernos in
OL,13,FStourbridge, Highter's Heath, Oldbury,
OL,14,FCastle Vale and Kings Norton to name a
OL,15,Ffew.
OL,17,FDozens of people were injured as the
OL,18,Fblazes wreaked havoc across the region
OL,19,Fon the hottest day of the year so far
OL,20,Fon Thursday, August 13.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
