FL,344,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786816101
OL,3,CDevastated residents share their
OL,4,Cstories in aftermath of Midlands fires
OL,6,FShama Kumar has lived in Stourbridge
OL,7,Ffor more than 25 years and her house
OL,8,Fis behind a police cordon.
OL,10,FShe said: "Today I just came to get my
OL,11,Fmedicine and some clothes, but I was
OL,12,Fonly allowed to get my medicine. Since
OL,13,FThursday I have been wearing the same
OL,14,Fclothes.
OL,16,F"It's devastating. My back garden is
OL,17,Fall gone. Luckily my house is safe,
OL,18,Fbut everybody's back garden is gone.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,344,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786816101
OL,3,CDevastated residents share their
OL,4,Cstories in aftermath of Midlands fires
OL,6,F"On Thursday it was very hot, we had
OL,7,Fleft all the windows open. About 12
OL,8,Fo'clock in the afternoon I smelled
OL,9,Fsmoke and thought I had left the stove
OL,10,Fon, or there had been a short circuit,
OL,11,Fbut everything was fine.
OL,13,F"Then I can hear the fire brigade, and
OL,14,Fshut all the windows upstairs. Then
OL,15,Fabout half-past-two, I see people
OL,16,Frunning on the street and someone at
OL,17,Fthe door tells me to come outside
OL,18,Fimmediately.
OL,20,F"I grabbed my bag and my passport and
OL,21,FI took my car out.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,344,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786816101
OL,3,CDevastated residents share their
OL,4,Cstories in aftermath of Midlands fires
OL,6,F"I have a close friend who lives
OL,7,Fnearby, her house was safe, so I've
OL,8,Fbeen staying there ever since. I don't
OL,9,Fknow when we will be allowed back
OL,10,Fhome. It's very hard."
OL,12,FMeanwhile in Kings Heath, Andrew
OL,13,FReynolds has spoken about seeing his
OL,14,Fmother's house completely destroyed.
OL,16,FHe said: "I'm just devastated. Mom's
OL,17,Flost everything, neighbours have lost
OL,18,Feverything.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,344,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786816101
OL,3,CDevastated residents share their
OL,4,Cstories in aftermath of Midlands fires
OL,6,F"I've been here since the fire broke
OL,7,Fout, and I haven't gone home because
OL,8,Fnothing's been secure until now.
OL,10,F"All the family photos were in there,
OL,11,Fall my family's jewellery from my nan
OL,12,Fand grandad, hundreds of years worth
OL,13,Fof family photos, some of which I'd
OL,14,Fnever seen and now never will. It's
OL,15,Fall just gone.
OL,17,F"When I first heard about it I got a
OL,18,Fphone call saying there was a fire at
OL,19,Fmy moms house. I raced over here as
OL,20,Fquick as I could but it was already
OL,21,Ftoo late. Everything was engulfed.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,344,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786816101
OL,3,CDevastated residents share their
OL,4,Cstories in aftermath of Midlands fires
OL,6,F"All I could see was big balls of
OL,7,Fflames and smoke.
OL,9,F"Hats off to the entire fire service,
OL,10,Fthey did the absolute best they could.
OL,11,FThe first crew here was from Coventry
OL,12,Fbecause our ones were already in
OL,13,FStourbridge.
OL,15,F"I'm sure in time my mom will find
OL,16,Fsomewhere different to live, but it's
OL,17,Fnot going to be the same. That was
OL,18,Fhome, lots of good memories in there,
OL,19,Fand it's all gone now.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,344,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1786816101
OL,3,CDevastated residents share their
OL,4,Cstories in aftermath of Midlands fires
OL,6,F"My own mental health has kind of
OL,7,Ftaken a back seat, because I've been
OL,8,Ffocussed on my mom and the neighbours,
OL,9,Fand just doing what we can."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
